  "label": "Meme Format: 'No One: [Person]'",
  "description": "The format 'no one: [Person]' is a common meme structure used to imply that the person is the sole exception to a rule, often in a humorous or sarcastic way. In this case, it is used to imply Hawking is the only one who cannot do something, which is a form of mockery.",
